DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate local authors Treslyn Vassel and Sahle Robinson
  (illustrator) and their new picture book\, NAHLIYA AND THE LADY! In this 
 heartfelt story about reunion\, forgiveness\, and finding home\, Nahliya i
 s finally reunited with the Lady--in a new country\, with new fears. As th
 ey build a home from faded memories\, she discovers the courage to forgive
  and open her heart to love again.\nNAHLIYA AND THE LADY is on sale now at
  A Different Booklist\, and will be available for purchase at the event.\n
 Free to attend. Fun for the whole family - see you there!
LOCATION:779 Bathurst St
URL:https://adifferentbooklist.com/events
X-SOURCE:A Different Booklist
END:VEVENT
